---
<Base title="AMI | Take the initiative." description="Big ideas start small. Arizona Microcredit Initiative empowers local entrepreneurs with free consulting, business education, and low-interest microloans." mainClass="modern-home">
 <LandingExperience>
 <div class="hero-carousel" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Featured at AMI">
  <div class="hc-panels">
  <div class="hc-panel is-active" data-panel role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="1 of 3: West Valley Pitch Competition">
   <section class="hcp dark">
    <div class="hcp-copy">
     <h2 class="hcp-h">Bring your<br/>business to the<br/><em>stage.</em></h2>
     <p class="hcp-lede">A free pitch competition for West Valley entrepreneurs, run by AMI with the economic development teams of Peoria, Goodyear, and Avondale. Learn in October, pitch on stage October 24, compete for a share of $10,000.</p>
     <div class="hcp-actions">
      <a class="hcp-button hcp-green-button" href="/pitch-comp#workshops">Sign up for a workshop <span aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></span></a>
     </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="hcp-photo">
     <img src="/media/pitch-winners-2026.jpg" alt="Entrepreneurs and community members at an AMI pitch competition" width="5712" height="4284" loading="lazy"/>
     <div class="hcp-prize" aria-label="$10,000 in prizes on October 24"><strong>$10,000</strong><span>In prizes</span></div>
    </figure>
    <div class="hcp-sponsors">
     <p class="hcp-eyebrow">Organized with. Supported by.</p>
     <MotionBanner label="Pitch competition sponsors and partners" variant="partners">
      <span class="logo-tile"><img src="/media/pitch-partners/peoria.webp" alt="City of Peoria Economic Development" loading="lazy"/></span>
      <span class="logo-tile"><img src="/media/pitch-partners/avondale.webp" alt="City of Avondale" loading="lazy"/></span>
      <span class="logo-tile"><img src="/media/pitch-partners/goodyear.webp" alt="City of Goodyear" loading="lazy"/></span>
      <span class="logo-tile"><img src="/media/pitch-partners/srp.webp" alt="SRP" loading="lazy"/></span>
      <span class="logo-tile"><img src="/media/pitch-partners/aps.webp" alt="APS" loading="lazy"/></span>
      <span class="logo-tile"><img src="/media/pitch-partners/integro.webp" alt="Integro Bank Foundation" loading="lazy"/></span>
      <span class="logo-tile dark-logo"><img src="/media/pitch-partners/mamacitas.png" alt="MamaCitas Mommy Dates" loading="lazy"/></span>
     </MotionBanner>
    </div>
    <dl class="hcp-facts">
     <div><dt>When</dt><dd>Sat, Oct 24<br/>11 a.m. to 3 p.m.</dd></div>
     <div><dt>Where</dt><dd>Rio Vista Recreation Center<br/>Peoria</dd></div>
     <div><dt>Cost</dt><dd>Free<br/>Workshops and entry</dd></div>
     <div><dt>Who</dt><dd>West Valley business owners<br/>and founders</dd></div>
    </dl>
   </section>
  </div>
<div class="hc-panel" data-panel role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="2 of 3: Integro Bank Foundation logo competition" aria-hidden="true">
   <section class="hcl dark">
    <div class="hcl-copy">
     <p class="hcl-eyebrow">Open call for Arizona designers</p>
